/2015/11/21/7874265/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も乃木ぷぷ出ます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/21/7874265/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7週連続です、ありがとうございます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回はまさかのノーカットというね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ノーカット怖いよ～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/11/21/7874265/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見てね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-15587":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は\nバレッタ初握手会でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"横浜で全握も初めてだっけ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブレポ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セトリ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バレッタ\n初恋の人を今でも\n-MC-\n私のために　誰かのために\nやさしさとは\n月の大きさ\nそんなバカな・・・"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MCでは2期生も登場したり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BIRTHDAY LIVEのDVD化の\n発表がありました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして握手"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりちゃと一緒のレーンでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/12/08/0209549/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にたくさんの方々が来てくださって\n嬉しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりちゃ中田の13レーンが\n一番最後に終わったので\n締めの挨拶もさせていただきました＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},